# CeraLive: unlock a carrier-locked Fibocom FM350-GL (AT+GTLOCKCAR=0) so its
# carrier profile follows the SIM again; see the script's header.
# One oneshot instance per added USB device (coldplug included), keyed by its
# kernel name, e.g. ceralive-modem-carrierlock@10-1.4.service. 0e8d:7127 is the
# FM350-GL's USB mode 41 (RNDIS); the model check and every decision are in the
# script. add-only: a module that restarts on the unlock comes back as a new
# device whose own instance reads the lock back.
ACTION=="add", SUBSYSTEM=="usb", ENV{DEVTYPE}=="usb_device", ATTR{idVendor}=="0e8d", ATTR{idProduct}=="7127", TAG+="systemd", ENV{SYSTEMD_WANTS}+="ceralive-modem-carrierlock@%k.service"
